msgid ""
"The super global to check within for the variable. |br| Can be any of "
"``GET|POST|REQUEST|COOKIE|SERVER|FILES``. |br| Defaults to ``REQUEST``."
msgstr ""
"Den super-global, hvori variablen skal kontrolleres. |br| Kan være en af "
