#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:102
msgid "is_set_post"
msgstr "is_set_post"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:103
msgid ""
"Checks whether a certain variable was sent via a ``POST`` request. To make "
"sure that a request was sent using ``POST`` you should call this function on"
" at least one variable. This is a short hand for "
"``$request->variable('variable', "
"\\phpbb\\request\\request_interface::POST);``."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerer, om en bestemt variabel blev sendt via en "
"``POST``-forespørgsel. For at sikre dig, at en forespørgsel blev sendt med "
"``POST``, bør du kalde denne funktion på mindst én variabel. Dette er en "
"forkortelse for ``$request->variable('variable', "
"\\phpbb\\request\\request_interface::POST);``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:107
msgid "Example of checking POST variables"
msgstr "Eksempel på kontrol af POST-variabler"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:128
msgid "variable"
msgstr "variable"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:129
msgid ""
"This is the central function for handling any input. All variables in "
"``GET`` or ``POST`` requests should be retrieved through this function to "
"maximise security."
msgstr ""
"Dette er den centrale funktion til håndtering af al input. Alle variabler i "
"``GET``- eller ``POST``-forespørgsler bør hentes via denne funktion for at "
"maksimere sikkerheden."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:132
msgid ""
"The variable name should be the value of HTML input's name attribute to "
"retrieve. So for ``<input name=\"subject\" type=\"text\">`` the variable "
"name is ``subject``."
msgstr ""
"Variabelnavnet bør være værdien af HTML-input'ets name-attribut, der skal "
"hentes. Så for ``<input name=\"subject\" type=\"text\">`` er variabelnavnet "
"``subject``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:135
msgid ""
"The default value should be of the exact same type of the expected input. "
"This is necessary, as the retrieved variables are type casted to the exact "
"same type. If no variable was available in the request, it will return the "
"provided default value."
msgstr ""
"Standardværdien bør være af nøjagtig samme type som det forventede input. "
"Dette er nødvendigt, da de hentede variabler castes til nøjagtig samme type."
" Hvis ingen variabel var tilgængelig i forespørgslen, returneres den angivne"
" standardværdi."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:139
msgid ""
"When the value that is being requested is a string or an array containing "
"strings, the ``multibyte`` parameter should be set to ``true``. Or better "
"said, whenever the requested value may contain any UTF-8 characters. Meaning"
" you will not have to run the returned value through ``utf8_normalize_nfc``."
" If set to ``false``, it will cause all bytes outside the ASCII range "
"*(0-127)* to be replaced with question marks."
msgstr ""
"Når den værdi, der forespørges, er en streng eller et array indeholdende "
"strenge, bør parameteren ``multibyte`` sættes til ``true``. Eller mere "
"præcist, når den forespurgte værdi kan indeholde UTF-8-tegn. Det betyder, at"
" du ikke behøver at sende den returnerede værdi gennem "
"``utf8_normalize_nfc``. Hvis den sættes til ``false``, vil alle bytes uden "
"for ASCII-området *(0-127)* blive erstattet med spørgsmålstegn."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:144
msgid "Example of default usage"
msgstr "Eksempel på standardanvendelse"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:156
msgid ""
"It is also possible to specify from which super global the variable should "
"be retrieved. This can help ensuring the correct variable is returned or the"
" form is submitted through the expected manner."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at angive, fra hvilken super-global variablen skal "
"hentes. Dette kan hjælpe med at sikre, at den korrekte variabel returneres, "
"eller at formularen indsendes på den forventede måde."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:159
msgid "Example of specifying a super global"
msgstr "Eksempel på angivelse af en super-global"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:166
msgid ""
"If the default value is an array, it is possible to nest it as deeply as is "
"required. There are no limitations for the nested depth."
msgstr ""
"Hvis standardværdien er et array, er det muligt at indlejre det så dybt som "
"nødvendigt. Der er ingen begrænsning for indlejringsdybden."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:169
msgid "Example of nesting arrays for default value"
msgstr "Eksempel på indlejring af arrays som standardværdi"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:178
msgid ""
"An additional capability is the path syntax. This allows you to access a "
"single value at a deep location (nested input) while making sure the types "
"are still correct. This can be achieved by passing an array as the variable "
"name. Each value in this array represent a key for the request array. The "
"nesting increased with each value provided."
msgstr ""
"En yderligere funktion er stisyntaksen. Denne giver dig mulighed for at "
"tilgå en enkelt værdi på en dyb placering (indlejret input), samtidig med at"
" typerne stadig er korrekte. Dette kan opnås ved at sende et array som "
"variabelnavnet. Hver værdi i dette array repræsenterer en nøgle i "
"forespørgselsarrayet. Indlejringen øges med hver angivet værdi."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:184
msgid "Example of the path syntax"
msgstr "Eksempel på stisyntaksen"

